### 결제 API 예제 요청 모음

@pay-url = http://localhost:8082
@roomId = 1
@roomSessionId = 1
@myUserId = 1

### 1. 계좌 거래 내역 조회
POST {{pay-url}}/api/v1/expenses/account-history
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

{}

### 2. OCR 실행
POST {{pay-url}}/api/v1/expenses/ocr
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="receipt.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./receipt.jpg
--Boundary--

### 3. 결제 참여자 조회
GET {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses/participants
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

### 4. 결제안 등록
POST {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

{
  "roomSessionId": {{roomSessionId}},
  "title": "저녁 식사 정산",
  "totalAmount": 120000,
  "paidAt": "2026-03-12T14:30:00",
  "inputType": "MANUAL",
  "participants": [
    { "userId": {{myUserId}}, "splitAmount": 40000 },
    { "userId": 2, "splitAmount": 40000 },
    { "userId": 3, "splitAmount": 40000 }
  ],
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "삼겹살 3인분",
      "totalAmount": 90000,
      "quantity": 3,
      "splits": [
        { "userId": {{myUserId}}, "splitAmount": 30000, "quantity": 1 },
        { "userId": 2, "splitAmount": 30000, "quantity": 1 },
        { "userId": 3, "splitAmount": 30000, "quantity": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "음료",
      "totalAmount": 30000,
      "quantity": 3,
      "splits": [
        { "userId": {{myUserId}}, "splitAmount": 10000, "quantity": 1 },
        { "userId": 2, "splitAmount": 10000, "quantity": 1 },
        { "userId": 3, "splitAmount": 10000, "quantity": 1 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 5. 모임방 결제안 목록 조회
GET {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

### 6. 내가 생성한 결제안 목록 조회
GET {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

### 7. OCR 원본 응답 확인
POST {{pay-url}}/api/v1/expenses/ocr/raw
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="receipt.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./receipt.jpg
--Boundary--
